### Phase 5 — S2b-2: Read sweep, analysis/ai_support/types + cross-crate

**Goal.** Complete the read sweep: `crates/engine/src/analysis/`, `crates/engine/src/ai_support/`, `crates/engine/src/types/` (the 2 `game_state.rs` occurrences not already covered by Phase 3's accessor definition itself), plus the cross-crate reads in `phase-ai`, `engine-wasm`, `phase-llm`.

