**Verification plan.** `phase-llm/src/render/game.rs`: a rendering test showing the non-canonical seat's render no longer reports an empty library/graveyard (revert-failing: revert the accessor swap, render goes empty again). Remaining AI read-swap sites get accessor-correctness unit tests where a card-level test isn't available (most of `ai_support`/`phase-ai` here are heuristics, not player-facing rules) — semantic correctness of the heuristic itself is `DEFERRED(phase 11)`.

**Deferral list.** AI heuristic semantic fixes on these same files (→ Phase 11); filter/dedup (→ Phase 6).

